              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Petitioners argue that the statutory phrase \u201cshall before October\u202f1,\u202f1993\u201d should be read as allowing the Commissioner to assign beneficiaries before or after that date."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner Barnhart",
          "citations": [
            {
