              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 4,
                "start": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner Barnhart, they contend that the deadline is mandatory but not jurisdictional, so the Commissioner retains authority to make assignments after October\u202f1,\u202f1993 if necessary."
        }
